Here is the semantic interpretation of the provided scene images using the given OWL ontology:

---

### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanNighttimeLaneChangeWithTraffic" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :description "Unpredictable lane change by lead vehicle in low-light urban setting" ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasObstacle :vehicle2 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Lead vehicle (yellow) performing abrupt lane change" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Following vehicle (black) at risk of collision due to lead vehicle's maneuver" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Vehicle motion blur indicates sudden acceleration/deceleration" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light urban environment with artificial lighting" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of rear-end collision due to lead vehicle's abrupt lane change" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Lead vehicle intruding into adjacent lane without clear signaling" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.88"^^xsd:float .
```

